{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2016-03", "window": 2, "start_date": 1457395200, "end_date": 1458086399, "month_true_total": 64, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:51:57 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "21859315", "author": {"steamid": "76561198094540797", "personaname": "Vindictus", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/pownzerx/", "num_games_owned": 346, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 4123, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3661, "last_played": 1633023422, "avatar": "fe7d36c1d064a335612a41f77a969ea6c9ba4d2c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very good game, about 7-10 hours going through the campaign first time through, especially if your collecting everything space marines feel like space marines (Heavy, massive power armour wearing tanks.) and it feels good to rip through a horde of greenskins with a thunder hammer. For the Emperor.", "timestamp_created": 1458076666, "timestamp_updated": 1458076666, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "21858069", "author": {"steamid": "76561198095857748", "personaname": "Loryiana", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ItalianGrill/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1762, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 691, "last_played": 1703078711, "avatar": "a41301d4b9e1d39dda8f88f1c057b74f846482c7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Space marine, blood and orcs, what else would you ask for?", "timestamp_created": 1458071926, "timestamp_updated": 1458071926, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.502487540245056152", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "21846719", "author": {"steamid": "76561198133987840", "personaname": "Tyrannicus Exterminatus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198133987840/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 2830, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1920, "last_played": 1464603882, "avatar": "377734f614149e6849ddd52bee27c6f7907adf71"}, "language": "english", "review": "20/10 risked getting in serious trouble just to get this game,got lucky getting it with the dlc during the sale,my my this masterpiece of a game is worth it!", "timestamp_created": 1458016252, "timestamp_updated": 1460186577, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "21845975", "author": {"steamid": "76561198032528294", "personaname": "Warriorsage", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198032528294/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 100, "playtime_forever": 1085, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 758, "last_played": 1466828484, "avatar": "c8a0ff3733f06c3c4159ebceffb0ee7682320def"}, "language": "english", "review": "I know nothing about Warhammer.  I don't know why orks who are basically scrapyard junkers can fly spaceships, why it's the far future but humanity worships a machine god, why some of the dialogue is vaguely medieval, or why Space Marines are all at least SEVEN FEET TALL.  \n\nWhat I do know is that this is a pretty decent third-person shooter.  It's basically Warcraft (which I DO know about) meets Gears of War.  The campaign will only last you 7-8 hours, and from what I understand, the multiplayer has several modes (thanks to AFatalPapercut for correcting me on this)  but no campaign co-op.  If it's on a good sale, pick it up.  \n\nGraphics are pretty decent, but with few customization options.  Voice acting is good, optimization is so-so considering the game is 5 years old.  There are occasional absurd difficulty spikes, but the controls are easy, and mingling a fair amount of melee weapons and combat into the game works surprisingly well.", "timestamp_created": 1458011846, "timestamp_updated": 1458634827, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "21845577", "author": {"steamid": "76561198064767116", "personaname": "EduardoALF", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198064767116/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1356, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1050, "last_played": 1725781901, "avatar": "f013b976da3e5744e5e106ea237837688ca38cb6"}, "language": "english", "review": "personally my favorite TPS of all times", "timestamp_created": 1458009409, "timestamp_updated": 1458009409, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}